AUDIO: 'And about half of closed that were dedicated to music NFTs. Music NFTs do still exist, but I think because of the huge destruction of the NFT market, that has quite rightly had a huge impact'

[00:26] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'on music NFTs specifically as well as all other NFTs, which is why the market is so bad right now. So even if Bitcoin goes up, if even if cryptocurrency goes up and tokens goes up, doesn\'t necessarily mean that NFTs'

[00:39] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'are ever going to really come back in mainstream market. Um so I found that really interesting, but last night I even looked into Bitcoin ordinals, which are the NFTs that are actually'

[00:51] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'minted on the Bitcoin network and they\'ve taken a big hit as well in terms of platforms not facilitating them anymore, focusing on other blockchains. And it\'s been a bit of a shock really,'

