VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'Bandcamp. Sound.xyz, I was very gutted when that actually went down. Um So in terms of the cause, there wasn\'t enough crypto native music fans. I think there is a barrier of entry. You have to'

[08:28] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'understand a bit of crypto. You have to get a crypto wallet. You have to connect that wallet to the platform. You have to find what you want to do. You want to make sure you got cryptocurrency of that amount or more in your digital wallet before you can actually acquire or buy'

[08:40] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'an NFT. So there was a lot of caveats to this, and I think that really did lead to the demise of music NFTs. Um the other issue that there was was was that'

