AUDIO: 'attention. And I think because of the barrier of entry coupled with that, there was going to be an issue with um streaming economics. A lot of the problems that I found with the music NFT platforms, when they went under, they'

[10:07] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'really went under. Some went out with no warning whatsoever to the users. A lot of musicians actually lost their NFTs cuz even though they were on the blockchain, it was that platform that actually viewed those NFTs. So, when the'

