VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'IO. Where we sit currently, Catalog\'s gone, Sound\'s gone. There\'s still Patreon. There\'s on-chain music release metadata experiments still going on. Uh there is um not much to hear about'

[10:47] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
